{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create. Manage. Share. Your World, Your Rules.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a <strong>sandbox simulation game</strong> where creativity meets strategy.<br>Play in beautifully crafted <strong>built-in worlds</strong>, or unleash your imagination to <strong>build your own</strong> from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a powerful <strong>editor and creation platform</strong>, you can design unique stories and management experiences\u2014<strong>and share them with players worldwide</strong>. Export your worlds, explore others\u2019 creations, and build the ultimate community-driven universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love <strong>simulation and management games</strong>, this is the perfect playground for you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972520?t=1757578387","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/3cc3d0b007c849362575b7557a04090b541004ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757578387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/e8fed13a8f49f55d35832ca9ab31f78ba7b59ac9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757578387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/e8fed13a8f49f55d35832ca9ab31f78ba7b59ac9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757578387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create. Manage. Share. Your World, Your Rules.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a <strong>sandbox simulation game</strong> where creativity meets strategy.<br>Play in beautifully crafted <strong>built-in worlds</strong>, or unleash your imagination to <strong>build your own</strong> from the ground up.</